---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="佛学圆桌" description="佛学代表人物圆桌研讨">
  <article class="page-hero yt-page">
    <div class="wrap yt-hero">
      <a class="yt-back" href="/yantao/">← 返回研讨</a>
      <p class="group-label" style="margin-top: 0;">研讨</p>
      <h1>佛学圆桌</h1>
      <p>提出议题后，主持人将邀请佛学相关代表人物对谈。可用指令：可 / 止 / 深入此节 / 引入新人物。</p>
      <aside class="yt-notice" role="note">
        <strong>请注意</strong>
        本模块对话由网络公开资料与模型生成，并不严格依据本站学修文稿；仅供启发参考，不可当作正式学修依据，更不能替代依止上师与如理实修。
      </aside>

      <div id="yt-sem-setup" class="yt-setup">
        <label class="yt-label" for="yt-topic">研讨议题</label>
        <textarea id="yt-topic" class="yt-textarea" rows="3" placeholder="例如：世间八法与修行的关系"></textarea>
        <div class="yt-actions">
          <button type="button" id="yt-sem-start" class="yt-btn">开启圆桌</button>
        </div>
        <p id="yt-sem-msg" class="yt-msg" hidden></p>
      </div>

      <div id="yt-sem-chat-wrap" class="yt-chat-wrap yt-hidden">
        <p id="yt-sem-meta" class="yt-msg" style="margin-top:0;"></p>
        <div id="yt-sem-chat" class="yt-chat" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="yt-composer">
          <div class="yt-chips" id="yt-sem-chips">
            <button type="button" class="yt-chip" data-cmd="可">可</button>
            <button type="button" class="yt-chip" data-cmd="止">止</button>
            <button type="button" class="yt-chip" data-cmd="深入此节">深入此节</button>
            <button type="button" class="yt-chip" data-cmd="引入新人物">引入新人物</button>
          </div>
          <textarea id="yt-sem-input" class="yt-textarea" rows="3" placeholder="输入回应，或点上方指令…"></textarea>
          <div class="yt-actions">
            <button type="button" id="yt-sem-send" class="yt-btn">发送</button>
            <button type="button" id="yt-sem-reset" class="yt-btn yt-btn--ghost">新议题</button>
          </div>
          <p id="yt-sem-status" class="yt-msg" hidden></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/yantao.css?v=20260805y" />
<script src="/yantao-seminar.js?v=20260730e" defer></script>
